      description : "WNDF-AV-000043 - Microsoft Defender AV must block Adobe Reader from creating child processes."
      info        : "This policy setting prevents Adobe Reader from launching other processes, which can help mitigate security risks associated with malicious PDF files."
      solution    : 'Set the policy value for Computer Configuration >> Administrative Templates >> Windows Components >> Microsoft Defender Antivirus >> Microsoft Defender Exploit Guard >> Attack Surface Reduction >> Configure Attack Surface Reduction rules to \'Enabled\'.

